  "question": "Which stadium are present within a 100 kilometers limit as I go toward Paul Lange Arboretum, Delavan, WI from SpringHill Suites by Marriott, Milwaukee, WI?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.915624 43.039788)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-88.649647 42.638262)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE leisure = 'stadium'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.915624 43.039788)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-87.915624 43.039788)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
